{"_id":"2e2409651a4cc33a","name":"Super Earthling","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>You push your body to an extreme size to give you extra strength, you are treated as one size category larger when determining carrying capacity.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <em><strong>Power Bonus</strong></em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speeds</em> by 5 ft.</li>\n<li>1 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rank 2 Power-Up</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-earthling","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":2,"family":"","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"1 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":1,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Earthlings"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3795,"endLine":3805},"formFamily":""}}}
{"_id":"04fc34cd75d27f65","name":"Earthling Potential","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>Release your inner potential</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 <em><strong>Power Bonus</strong></em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speeds</em> by 10 ft.</li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rank 3 Power-Up</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"earthling-potential","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":3,"family":"","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Earthlings"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3806,"endLine":3824},"formFamily":""}}}
{"_id":"30d3445d090f1cfc","name":"Capacity Breaker","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>Push your regulators to their limits.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <em><strong>Power Bonus</strong></em></li>\n<li>You deal +1d4 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speeds</em> by 5 feet</li>\n<li>1 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"capacity-breaker","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Upgraded Potential","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"1 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":1,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Androids; Upgraded Potential"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3831,"endLine":3840},"formFamily":"Upgraded Potential"}}}
{"_id":"bb3872a7c727a331","name":"Overdrive","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>Set your regulators to dangerous levels.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 <em><strong>Power Bonus</strong></em></li>\n<li>You deal +1d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speeds</em> by 25 feet</li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"overdrive","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Upgraded Potential","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Androids; Upgraded Potential"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3841,"endLine":3849},"formFamily":"Upgraded Potential"}}}
{"_id":"5031f502b9eb6f31","name":"Super Android","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Transformation</em></p>\n<p>Through extreme modifications or merging of other technologies, you can temporarily become more than your original design.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+4 <em><strong>Power Bonus</strong></em></li>\n<li>You deal +2d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speeds</em> by 40 feet</li>\n<li>You gain +2 to your <strong>AC</strong></li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-android","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"God Forms","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":4,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Androids; God Forms"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3852,"endLine":3862},"formFamily":"God Forms"}}}
{"_id":"1de086c66aef0934","name":"Ultimate Android","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>You have learned to seamlessly mix your ki with your mechanical energy source, pushing your mechanisms “Even further beyond!”</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <em><strong>Power Bonus</strong></em></li>\n<li>You deal +2d8 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speeds</em> by 20 feet</li>\n<li>You gain +1 to your <strong>AC</strong></li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ultimate-android","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"God Forms","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Androids; God Forms"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3863,"endLine":3875},"formFamily":"God Forms"}}}
{"_id":"67e31db4d4a28ff8","name":"Second Form","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The arcosian’s body grows and your horns extend upwards like a bull</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 5 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain the Empowered Condition.</li>\n<li>1 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained at Level 5</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"second-form","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Gates of Power","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"1 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":1,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at Level 5","tags":"Arcosian; Gates of Power"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3879,"endLine":3890},"formFamily":"Gates of Power"}}}
{"_id":"c2d987de7721ae0c","name":"Third Form","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The arcosian’s body elongates to that of a Xenomorph.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 10 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain the <em><strong>Super-Charged</strong></em> Condition</li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Ki Technique</em> range by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained at Level 10</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"third-form","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Gates of Power","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at Level 10","tags":"Arcosian; Gates of Power"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3891,"endLine":3903},"formFamily":"Gates of Power"}}}
{"_id":"ada57118d2935942","name":"Fourth Form","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The arcosian shrinks down to their true form.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 25 ft.</li>\n<li>When a creature would fail a <strong>Ki Technique's</strong> <em>Saving Throw</em> by 10 or more, they take additional <em>Damage</em> equal to double your Proficiency Bonus</li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained Level 15</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"fourth-form","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Gates of Power","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained Level 15","tags":"Arcosian; Gates of Power"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3904,"endLine":3916},"formFamily":"Gates of Power"}}}
{"_id":"1ed0653ffa1afb38","name":"100% Power Fourth Form","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The user pushes their body to their unaided maximum</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>You deal +1d10 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 25 ft.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>You gain +2 <em>Bulk</em></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>When a creature would fail a <strong>Ki Technique</strong> or <strong>Melee/Weapon Technique</strong> by 10 or more, they take additional <em>Damage</em> equal to double your Proficiency Bonus</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>4 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained at Level 15</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"100-power-fourth-form","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Gates of Power","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"4 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at Level 15","tags":"Arcosian; Gates of Power"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3917,"endLine":3933},"formFamily":"Gates of Power"}}}
{"_id":"06227e916edf9c1d","name":"Fifth Form","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The arcosian’s body changes into a large armored form</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+4 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +2d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain the <em><strong>Empowered</strong></em> Condition.</li>\n<li>You gain +1 to your <strong>AC</strong></li>\n<li>4 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Unlocked as if it is a Rank 4 technique.</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"fifth-form","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":4,"family":"Gates of Power","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"4 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":4,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Arcosian; Gates of Power"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3934,"endLine":3947},"formFamily":"Gates of Power"}}}
{"_id":"7251fe9e90e72b76","name":"Golden form","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>The user’s body turns golden except for the area around the mouth, center of the chest, hands, feet, and knees.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d8 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase your <em>Movement Speed</em> by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain an additional +2 to your AC</li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"golden-form","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Royal Forms","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Arcosian; Royal Forms"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3950,"endLine":3961},"formFamily":"Royal Forms"}}}
{"_id":"df5d78dfa393cadf","name":"Obsidian form","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>The user’s body turns black except for the area around the mouth, center of the chest, hands, feet, and knees.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+4 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d10 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 45 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain +3 to your <strong>AC</strong></li>\n<li>6 <strong>Stamina Activation</strong>, 5 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"obsidian-form","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Royal Forms","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"5 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":4,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Arcosian; Royal Forms"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3962,"endLine":3979},"formFamily":"Royal Forms"}}}
{"_id":"c33a4c0e615d1d64","name":"Super Namekian","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation/Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>Drawing out the powers of your Namekian fusion has created a Super Namekian!</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong> per Namekian you Fuse with to a maximum equal to your <em>Proficiency Bonus</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 5 ft. per Namekian you Fuse with to a maximum equal to your <em>Proficiency Bonus</em></li>\n<li>4 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong><ul>\n<li>This can be used as a <strong>Power-Up</strong> for 8 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Obtained after merging with at least 1 other Namekian</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-namekian","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Namekians","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"4 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":1,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Namekians"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3984,"endLine":3995},"formFamily":"Namekians"}}}
{"_id":"973644e5623c58ab","name":"Titan Namekian","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>Grow massive to overwhelm the enemy.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>At <strong>Level 5</strong> you may become a <em>Large</em> category, this increases to <em>Huge</em> at <strong>Level 10</strong> and <em>Gargantuan</em> at <strong>Level 20.</strong></li>\n<li>+1 <strong>Bulk</strong> and <strong>Power Bonus</strong> per each Size Category above your original size.</li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong> per <em>Size Category</em> raised.</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"titan-namekian","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Namekians","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":0,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"At **Level 5** you may become a *Large* category, this increases to *Huge* at **Level 10** and *Gargantuan* at **Level 20.","tags":"Namekians"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":3996,"endLine":4003},"formFamily":"Namekians"}}}
{"_id":"a15f444b2c4a62b8","name":"Namekian Split","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em><strong>Power-Up</strong></em>\n2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong> per split created.\nThe user draws from the power of those assimilated and expels a clone of himself fueled by them. Each clone has the same Ability Scores as the user but shares the user’s health and ki. Each split has its turn immediately following the caster.</p>\n<p>You may create a number of clones equal to the number of Namekians you have assimilated to a max equal to half your proficiency bonus rounded up.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>This is learned as a <strong>Rank 2 Technique</strong> if <em>Super Namekian</em> is known.</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"namekian-split","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":2,"family":"Namekians","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":0,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Namekians"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4004,"endLine":4016},"formFamily":"Namekians"}}}
{"_id":"afd3e41bf0d42710","name":"Orange Namekian","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The user’s crevices in their body disappear and they grow larger and broader as well as becoming a vibrant orange.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+4 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d10 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 40 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain the <em>Empowered Condition</em></li>\n<li>4 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"orange-namekian","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"God Forms","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"4 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":4,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Namekians; God Forms"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4019,"endLine":4029},"formFamily":"God Forms"}}}
{"_id":"b961d156026bafa3","name":"Red-Eyed Namekian","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>A Namekian that has obtained god ki can take an enhanced state with red eyes and a fiery aura.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d12 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain +2 to your <strong>AC</strong>.</li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"red-eyed-namekian","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"God Forms","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Namekians; God Forms"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4030,"endLine":4050},"formFamily":"God Forms"}}}
{"_id":"e6fa72f9b97692ae","name":"Great Ape (Power-Up)","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>When the light of a full moon or another similar celestial body hits a Saiyan’s eyes when they have a tail they become the mighty Great Ape. A Saiyan who does not have the blinded condition can make a <strong>DC 15</strong> <em>Wisdom Save</em> to avoid looking at the object and avoid transforming.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>When this <strong>Form</strong> activates and at the start of each turn you are in this form you must make a <strong>DC 15</strong> <em>Wisdom Saving Throw</em> to remain in control. If you fail this <em>Saving Throw</em>, hand control of your character to the DM for the remainder of the form.</li>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You gain your <em>Maximum HP</em> in <em>Temporary HP.</em></li>\n<li>+4 Ranks of <strong>Bulk</strong></li>\n<li>Your Size Category becomes <em>Huge</em></li>\n<li>You deal 2d8 to <em>Damage Rolls</em> dealt by your <em>Unarmed Strike</em> and <em>Basic Ki Blasts</em></li>\n<li>You can not use <strong>Techniques</strong> in this form</li>\n<li>Your Natural <strong>AC</strong> becomes 15 plus your <em>Constitution Modifier</em> plus half <em>Proficiency Bonus.</em></li>\n<li>You may be grappled by targets smaller than you (by your tail), you are treated as grappled but do not reduce your <em>Movement Speed</em> to Zero. While grappled in this way melee attacks against you have advantage as they attack your tail.</li>\n<li>You have advantage on attack rolls against the creature that is grappling you.</li>\n<li>This Power-Up lasts for 1 Hour or until you are knocked unconscious, your tail is removed, or the celestial body that triggered the transformation is no longer visible to you for 1 minute.</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"great-ape-power-up","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Oozaru","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Saiyans; Oozaru"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4055,"endLine":4071},"formFamily":"Oozaru"}}}
{"_id":"6b2141f3ee9bd86a","name":"Oozaru's Fury","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>Gained by the “Blood of the Great Ape” feat\nThe power of the great ape form was perfected in the normal body. The Saiyan’s hair spikes up but retains its natural color while their eyes turn golden. The Saiyan’s body also bulks up considerably, this however doesn’t affect their speed.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your <em>Unarmed Strike</em> and <em>Melee Technique Damage Die</em> are increased by 1 step.</li>\n<li>+1 Rank of <strong>Bulk</strong></li>\n<li>You gain the <em><strong>Empowered</strong></em> Condition.</li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"oozaru-s-fury","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Oozaru","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":0,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Saiyans; Oozaru"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4081,"endLine":4091},"formFamily":"Oozaru"}}}
{"_id":"e66ffcbd653f7b9e","name":"Wrath of the Saiyans","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>Your rage becomes personalized to explosive rage, your power shooting to a level beyond that, truly benefiting from the power you would from Oozaru without the need of the Moon but causes it to be more draining</p>\n<ul>\n<li>When this transformation activates and at the start of each turn you are in this form you must make a wisdom saving throw of 15 to remain in control. If you fail this saving throw, hand control of your character to the DM for the remainder of the form.</li>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Your <em>Unarmed Strike</em> and <em>Melee Technique</em> damage die are increased by 2 steps.</li>\n<li>You gain the <em><strong>Empowered</strong></em> Condition</li>\n<li>+2 Ranks of <strong>Bulk</strong></li>\n<li>This form functions as <em>Great Ape</em> for the sake of <strong>Feature</strong> and <strong>Form</strong> interactions.</li>\n<li>4 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"wrath-of-the-saiyans","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Oozaru","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"4 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Saiyans; Oozaru"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4092,"endLine":4105},"formFamily":"Oozaru"}}}
{"_id":"cde390174d28205f","name":"Super Saiyan 4","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>In this form, the Saiyan’s hair color differs, the same goes for the tail and the body is covered in red fur. A Saiyan in this form also possesses a shadow trim around their eyes and over the eyelids that varies in color, such as crimson.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d8 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>You gain the <em><strong>Empowered</strong></em> Condition</li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain a +2 to your Maximum and Current <strong>Strength</strong> and <strong>Dexterity</strong> Ability Score</li>\n<li>4 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>This <strong>Form</strong> counts as the <strong>Family</strong> that you chose from the <em>Saiyan Genetics</em> <strong>Racial Feature</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-saiyan-4","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Oozaru","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"4 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Saiyans; Oozaru"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4106,"endLine":4120},"formFamily":"Oozaru"}}}
{"_id":"b2e1844267f86ba0","name":"Super Saiyan 1","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The Saiyan’s hair turns blonde and stands on end and their eyes turn a vivid shade of emerald while a golden aura flows upward from them.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d4 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 10 ft.</li>\n<li>1 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-saiyan-1","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Super Saiyan","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"1 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":1,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Saiyans; Super Saiyan"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4123,"endLine":4132},"formFamily":"Super Saiyan"}}}
{"_id":"deb3eafe90ece1d6","name":"Super Saiyan 2","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The Saiyan’s hair appears to grow thicker than the SSJ 1 form and lightning begins to arc around them occasionally. Their aura is enough to levitate small rocks.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 20 ft.</li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-saiyan-2","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Super Saiyan","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Saiyans; Super Saiyan"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4133,"endLine":4142},"formFamily":"Super Saiyan"}}}
{"_id":"e914dae518bd9e30","name":"Super Saiyan 3","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The Saiyan’s hair lengthens to their waist and they take on a more Neanderthal look, their foreheads protrude and they lose their eyebrows, and lightning is almost always sparking around them slightly. When a Saiyan takes this form for the first time the world itself seems to take heed, the clouds in the sky will culminate above you, and lightning strikes occasionally.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d8 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 35 ft.</li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-saiyan-3","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Super Saiyan","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Saiyans; Super Saiyan"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4143,"endLine":4159},"formFamily":"Super Saiyan"}}}
{"_id":"87762c01062d9f76","name":"Grade 2","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The Super Saiyan’s muscle mass increases drastically, slowing them slightly but increasing their raw power.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d4 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Decrease all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 10 ft.</li>\n<li>+1 Rank of <strong>Bulk</strong></li>\n<li>1 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"grade-2","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Super Saiyan Grades","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"1 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":1,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Saiyans; Super Saiyan Grades"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4167,"endLine":4175},"formFamily":"Super Saiyan Grades"}}}
{"_id":"6e3173b6f6a80343","name":"Grade 4","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The Super Saiyan’s muscle mass recedes to just above normal and their hair becomes almost white-yellow.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>This form does not take up your <strong>Transformation Slot</strong>.</li>\n<li>1 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em><strong>The Combination Form of *Super Saiyan 1* and *Grade 4* can be activated as a *Bonus Action*.</strong></em></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"grade-4","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Super Saiyan Grades","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"1 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Saiyans; Super Saiyan Grades"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4186,"endLine":4196},"formFamily":"Super Saiyan Grades"}}}
{"_id":"5e2809be77332778","name":"Berserker Super Saiyan","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Berserker Transformation</em></p>\n<p>With the spark of your S-cells and the flood of legendary power, your mind seems ready to slip. Almost doubling in body mass with stark white eyes, your bright emerald hair spikes out in wild directions.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Starting Berserk DC = 12</li>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 20 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain +1 to <strong>AC</strong></li>\n<li>+1 Rank of <strong>Bulk</strong></li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Gained at Level 5</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"berserker-super-saiyan","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Super Saiyan Berserk","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":2,"berserker":true,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at Level 5","tags":"Mutant Saiyan; Super Saiyan Berserk"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4201,"endLine":4216},"formFamily":"Super Saiyan Berserk"}}}
{"_id":"1a08b85ca9bd3ccc","name":"Controlled Super Saiyan","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d4 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 15 ft.</li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"controlled-super-saiyan","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Super Saiyan Berserk","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Mutant Saiyan; Super Saiyan Berserk"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4217,"endLine":4224},"formFamily":"Super Saiyan Berserk"}}}
{"_id":"c6926bbae91f2869","name":"Berserker Super Saiyan 2","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Berserker Transformation</em></p>\n<p>Your emerald hair now stands straight up as lightning crackles around you almost exploding out of your enlarged frame. Every step sounds like distant thunder.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Starting Berserk DC = 14</li>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>You deal +1d8 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>You gain +2 to your <strong>AC</strong>.</li>\n<li>+2 Ranks of <strong>Bulk</strong></li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained at Level 10</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"berserker-super-saiyan-2","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Super Saiyan Berserk","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":3,"berserker":true,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at Level 10","tags":"Mutant Saiyan; Super Saiyan Berserk"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4225,"endLine":4240},"formFamily":"Super Saiyan Berserk"}}}
{"_id":"9bcc1b61d1856dff","name":"Controlled Super Saiyan 2","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 25 ft.</li>\n<li>You deal +1d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>+1 Rank of <strong>Bulk</strong></li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"controlled-super-saiyan-2","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Super Saiyan Berserk","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Mutant Saiyan; Super Saiyan Berserk"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4241,"endLine":4251},"formFamily":"Super Saiyan Berserk"}}}
{"_id":"977ce590127f7c03","name":"Berserker Super Saiyan 3","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Berserker Transformation</em></p>\n<p>Your emerald hair now begins to grow up to your knees as lightning crackles around you, almost shocking the surrounding. Every Step sounds like explosions.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Starting Berserk DC = 16</li>\n<li>+4 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase <em>all</em> Movement Speed by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>You deal +1d10 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>You gain +2 to your <strong>AC</strong>.</li>\n<li>+2 Ranks of <strong>Bulk</strong></li>\n<li>4 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained at Level 15</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"berserker-super-saiyan-3","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Super Saiyan Berserk","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"4 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":4,"berserker":true,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at Level 15","tags":"Mutant Saiyan; Super Saiyan Berserk"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4252,"endLine":4267},"formFamily":"Super Saiyan Berserk"}}}
{"_id":"440d4e11523eee0b","name":"Controlled Super Saiyan 3","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>+4 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 25 ft.</li>\n<li>You deal +1d8 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>+2 Ranks of <strong>Bulk</strong></li>\n<li>4 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"controlled-super-saiyan-3","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Super Saiyan Berserk","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"4 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":4,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Mutant Saiyan; Super Saiyan Berserk"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4268,"endLine":4276},"formFamily":"Super Saiyan Berserk"}}}
{"_id":"ffcf91193862ccc9","name":"Full Power Super Saiyan","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>Your true power has been unleashed and oddly enough it finally feels natural. You’re brilliant emerald eyes and hair shine with an almost unceasing brilliance.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+5 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>You deal +1d12 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>You gain +2 to your <strong>AC.</strong></li>\n<li>+2 Ranks of <strong>Bulk</strong>.</li>\n<li>7 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained at Level 20</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"full-power-super-saiyan","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Super Saiyan Berserk","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"7 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":5,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at Level 20","tags":"Mutant Saiyan; Super Saiyan Berserk"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4277,"endLine":4298},"formFamily":"Super Saiyan Berserk"}}}
{"_id":"892cd1ef27ce1311","name":"Legendary Grade 2","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You let control of the Berserker Rage leak out more, increasing your muscle mass drastically but in control</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d4 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Decrease all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 15 ft.</li>\n<li>+1 Ranks of <strong>Bulk</strong></li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"legendary-grade-2","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Legendary Grades","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":1,"berserker":true,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Mutant Saiyan; Legendary Grades"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4308,"endLine":4317},"formFamily":"Legendary Grades"}}}
{"_id":"93855eec82ebe65c","name":"Legendary Grade 4","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You master the rage and instead channel it through your controlled Super Saiyan, losing the raw strength but gaining a mastery of the form as you learn to control your rage through your Super Saiyan state</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>This form does not take up your <strong>Transformation Slot</strong>.</li>\n<li>1 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em><strong>The Combination Form of *Controlled Super Saiyan 1* and *Legendary Grade 4* can be activated as a *Bonus Action*.</strong></em></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"legendary-grade-4","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Legendary Grades","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"1 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Mutant Saiyan; Legendary Grades"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4328,"endLine":4348},"formFamily":"Legendary Grades"}}}
{"_id":"13cd9a1102dda12e","name":"Burst of Potential","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>The ancient Saiyan draws from their reserves of latent energy. A bestial scream erupts from them as their ki explodes outwards.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 10 ft.</li>\n<li>1 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained at Level 3</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"burst-of-potential","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Ancient Saiyan Power","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"1 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":1,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at Level 3","tags":"Ancient Saiyan; Ancient Saiyan Power"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4354,"endLine":4364},"formFamily":"Ancient Saiyan Power"}}}
{"_id":"8125b32fc7986b7f","name":"Draw from the S-cells","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>The Saiyan pulls power from their S-cells without tapping into the super Saiyan transformation, though their aura still shines with a golden hue.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You deal +2 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 5 ft.</li>\n<li>1 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained at Level 5 but is gained earlier if the “S-cell Awakening” feat is taken</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"draw-from-the-s-cells","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Ancient Saiyan Power","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"1 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":0,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at Level 5 but is gained earlier if the “S-cell Awakening” feat is taken","tags":"Ancient Saiyan; Ancient Saiyan Power"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4365,"endLine":4375},"formFamily":"Ancient Saiyan Power"}}}
{"_id":"a4b48a45ad6e1bd0","name":"Timeless power","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>This is the true raw power of the ancient Saiyans, their bodies bulk slightly like super Saiyans but otherwise look like their base form. Their ki rises off them like steam and they have been known to growl like animals.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 15 ft.</li>\n<li>You deal +1d4 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained at level 10</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"timeless-power","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Ancient Saiyan Power","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at level 10","tags":"Ancient Saiyan; Ancient Saiyan Power"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4376,"endLine":4397},"formFamily":"Ancient Saiyan Power"}}}
{"_id":"c23909a95fa4427b","name":"Pure Super Saiyan","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The ancient saiyan’s more powerful version of super Saiyan, the Saiyan’s eyes turn a shining emerald, and their hair spikes up and turns such a deep gold it appears to be solid gold. Their aura is enough to levitate small rocks.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 10 ft.</li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"pure-super-saiyan","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Ancient Super Saiyan","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":1,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Ancient Saiyan; Ancient Super Saiyan"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4400,"endLine":4410},"formFamily":"Ancient Super Saiyan"}}}
{"_id":"5c8407a7e47d2494","name":"Legendary Super Saiyan","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The form of the original super saiyan. This appears to be the only form in which an ancient saiyan retains its base disposition. This looks like the pure super saiyan form, accompanied by white lightning.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Increase your <strong>Power Bonus</strong> by your <strong>Ki Rank</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 25 ft.</li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"legendary-super-saiyan","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Ancient Super Saiyan","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":0,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Ancient Saiyan; Ancient Super Saiyan"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4411,"endLine":4420},"formFamily":"Ancient Super Saiyan"}}}
{"_id":"baa51ae201813da8","name":"Super Saiyan 3 Full Power","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>You gain the full strength of your dark ki combined with your Super Saiyan State. Awakening an enhanced version of Super Saiyan 3 with red eyes as opposed to blue eyes and a darkened ki. You must have the “Dark Ki” Power-Up Active in order to transform</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+4 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d10 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 20 Ft.</li>\n<li>When you would cast a <strong>Technique</strong>, you may spend an amount of stamina equal to half the ki rank, changing the damage type to necrotic.</li>\n<li>5 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-saiyan-3-full-power","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Ancient Super Saiyan","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"5 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":4,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Ancient Saiyan; Ancient Super Saiyan"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4421,"endLine":4433},"formFamily":"Ancient Super Saiyan"}}}
{"_id":"06ac7ccbdf1fe76e","name":"Super Saiyan God","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>Super Saiyan God is special in that until specific Feats are taken you may not use it alongside <em>Saiyan</em> <strong>Transformations</strong> at first. (if you can have more than 1 Power-Up active you still gain benefits from that)</p>\n<p>The user loses muscle mass and grows slightly taller while the user’s eyes and hair turn a fiery red and their aura looks like a raging inferno. This form is unlocked when a Saiyan unlocks God Ki or from the Super Saiyan God Ritual.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d12 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain +2 to your <strong>AC</strong>.</li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Super Saiyan God Ritual This ritual was lost to time long ago and can only be found out through special circumstances.</p>\n<p>Long ago there was a small group of 5 Good Aligned Saiyans that poured their energy into a 6th. This act created the first Super Saiyan God and can reproduce them. A Saiyan can only be a part of this ritual 1 time in their life. When activated via ritual it lasts 6 rounds.</p>\n<h5>Super Saiyan God Evolution</h5>\n<p><em>Godly Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>You may push your <em>Super Saiyan God</em> to further heights, your God Transformation becoming a darker coloration and your body becoming more defined.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +3d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain +2 to your <strong>AC.</strong></li>\n<li>+2 Ranks of <strong>Bulk</strong></li>\n<li>5 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h6>Divine Saiyan Forms</h6>\n<p>Occasionally a Saiyan is born with divine blood or one can be created through body snatching. Regardless when these holy or infernal Saiyans reach the level of the gods their forms are slightly altered.</p>\n<p>When a creature with the Celestial or Fiend tags uses Super Saiyan God they gain an additional +1 Power and have the color of their hair and aura slightly altered. This change in color overrides all Super Saiyan Transformations.</p>\n<p>These forms appear pink for Celestials and blood red for Infernals.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-saiyan-god","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Saiyan God Form","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Saiyan God Form"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4436,"endLine":4473},"formFamily":"Saiyan God Form"}}}
{"_id":"7780f024e173d4b5","name":"Super Saiyan God Evolution","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>You may push your <em>Super Saiyan God</em> to further heights, your God Transformation becoming a darker coloration and your body becoming more defined.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +3d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain +2 to your <strong>AC.</strong></li>\n<li>+2 Ranks of <strong>Bulk</strong></li>\n<li>5 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h6>Divine Saiyan Forms</h6>\n<p>Occasionally a Saiyan is born with divine blood or one can be created through body snatching. Regardless when these holy or infernal Saiyans reach the level of the gods their forms are slightly altered.</p>\n<p>When a creature with the Celestial or Fiend tags uses Super Saiyan God they gain an additional +1 Power and have the color of their hair and aura slightly altered. This change in color overrides all Super Saiyan Transformations.</p>\n<p>These forms appear pink for Celestials and blood red for Infernals.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-saiyan-god-evolution","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Super Saiyan God","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"5 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Saiyan God Form; Super Saiyan God"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4453,"endLine":4473},"formFamily":"Super Saiyan God"}}}
{"_id":"3afccb6f25d66a49","name":"Red Eye Activation","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>You have learned to actively harness your hyper-evolved eye. Your view is now slightly telescopic allowing you to aim and even snipe with your energy attacks.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You gain a +1 to all <strong>Wisdom (Perception) Checks</strong></li>\n<li>The range of all <em>Basic Ki Blasts</em> and <em>Ki Techniques</em> increase by 25% (1/4)</li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained at Level 5</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"red-eye-activation","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Red Eye","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at Level 5","tags":"Ceralian; Red Eye"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4477,"endLine":4488},"formFamily":"Red Eye"}}}
{"_id":"62dab0d238a92684","name":"Red Eyed Focus","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>Your Eye has reached its full potential and is even better than before.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You gain a +2 to all <strong>Wisdom (Perception) Checks</strong></li>\n<li>The range of all <em>Basic Ki Blasts</em> and <em>Ki Techniques</em> increase by 50% (1/2)</li>\n<li>Your <em>Critical Threat Range</em> increases by 1</li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>At level 10 this Power-Up replaces “Red Eye Activation”</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"red-eyed-focus","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Red Eye","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"At level 10 this Power-Up replaces “Red Eye Activation”","tags":"Ceralian; Red Eye"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4489,"endLine":4501},"formFamily":"Red Eye"}}}
{"_id":"d84d40153d13b309","name":"Double Red Eye Activation","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>You have awakened the power of Ceralians in both of your eyes.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+5 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You gain a +3 to all <strong>Wisdom (Perception) Checks</strong></li>\n<li>The range of all <em>Basic Ki Blasts</em> and <em>Ki Techniques</em> is doubled</li>\n<li>Your <em>Critical Threat Range</em> increases by 2</li>\n<li>5 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained at Level 15</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"double-red-eye-activation","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Red Eye","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"5 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":5,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at Level 15","tags":"Ceralian; Red Eye"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4502,"endLine":4516},"formFamily":"Red Eye"}}}
{"_id":"ec08137c55b9ad7c","name":"Purification","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>You access the pure form of a Majin, turning into a child-like version, but despite of the small size, you are full of uncontrollable power.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>All <em>Techniques</em> may use your Charisma Modifier in replace of the original Ability Modifier</li>\n<li>When you would deal damage with a <em>Technique</em>, you deal additional damage equal to your Charisma Modifier (Minimum 1)</li>\n<li>You gain the <em><strong>Berserk</strong></em> Condition.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained at Level 10</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"purification","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Majin","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at Level 10","tags":"Majin"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4521,"endLine":4542},"formFamily":"Majin"}}}
{"_id":"ed413d70a8917f70","name":"Dark energy","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Rank 2 Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>Your aura flares a deep blackish red and your eyes glow white. While you have this form active your alignment actively shifts 1 step down. (Good 》 Neutral 》Evil)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>1 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"dark-energy","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":2,"family":"Energy of Sesa's Family","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"1 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Mashin-Jins; Energy of Sesa's Family"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4549,"endLine":4556},"formFamily":"Energy of Sesa's Family"}}}
{"_id":"aec81716670f5c5a","name":"Flowing Dark Energy","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Rank 3 Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>Your aura flares a deep blackish red and your eyes glow white. While you have this form active your alignment actively shifts 1 step down. (Good 》 Neutral 》Evil)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +2d4 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"flowing-dark-energy","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":3,"family":"Energy of Sesa's Family","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Mashin-Jins; Energy of Sesa's Family"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4557,"endLine":4565},"formFamily":"Energy of Sesa's Family"}}}
{"_id":"9fb6b25772b6e791","name":"Demon god’s Mantle","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Rank 4 Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>You gain a coat of demonic energy as you draw directly upon your connection to Sesa.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 15 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain an additional +1 <strong>Static Bonus</strong> to <em>Spells</em> and <em>Ki Techniques</em></li>\n<li>You may cast <em>Spells</em> from the infernal legacy feature as a bonus action on your turn.</li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"demon-gods-mantle","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":4,"family":"Energy of Sesa's Family","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Mashin-Jins; Energy of Sesa's Family"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4566,"endLine":4577},"formFamily":"Energy of Sesa's Family"}}}
{"_id":"4d06548bbc7d1337","name":"Demon Form","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>You have unlocked the true form of the Mashin-jin, a huge demonic beast.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>+2 Ranks of <strong>Bulk</strong></li>\n<li>You gain the <em><strong>Empowered</strong></em> Condition</li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Gained at Level 15</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"demon-form","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Body of Sesa's Family","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Gained at Level 15","tags":"Mashin-Jins; Body of Sesa's Family"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4580,"endLine":4591},"formFamily":"Body of Sesa's Family"}}}
{"_id":"06631f577bc06c4d","name":"Makyouka Form","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Transformation</em></p>\n<p>You have merged your demon form with your regular form making an insanely powerful demon mode.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+4 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Damage Die</em> step by 1</li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain a +2 to your Maximum and Current <strong>Strength</strong> and <strong>Charisma</strong> Ability Score</li>\n<li>You gain the <em><strong>Super-Charged</strong></em> Condition</li>\n<li>5 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"makyouka-form","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"God Form","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"5 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":4,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Mashin-Jins; God Form"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4593,"endLine":4612},"formFamily":"God Form"}}}
{"_id":"10c8f12d863d28fc","name":"Kaio-Ken!","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li>+1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 10 ft.</li>\n<li>1 <strong>Hit Point Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"kaio-ken","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":1,"family":"Non-Race Specific","resource":"other","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"1 Hit Point","activation":"action","powerBonus":1,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4625,"endLine":4628},"formFamily":"Non-Race Specific"}}}
{"_id":"863fd9df8088300d","name":"Kaio-Ken x4!","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li>+1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 10 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain the <em>Super-Charged Condition</em></li>\n<li>2 <strong>Hit Point Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"kaio-ken-x4","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":1,"family":"Non-Race Specific","resource":"other","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Hit Point","activation":"action","powerBonus":1,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4629,"endLine":4633},"formFamily":"Non-Race Specific"}}}
{"_id":"d7f43dc4d857ed95","name":"Kaio-Ken x10!","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d4 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 15 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain the <em>Super-Charged Condition</em></li>\n<li>3 <strong>Hit Point Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"kaio-ken-x10","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":2,"family":"Non-Race Specific","resource":"other","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Hit Point","activation":"action","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4635,"endLine":4640},"formFamily":"Non-Race Specific"}}}
{"_id":"211618facb790c22","name":"Kaio-Ken x20!","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 20 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain the <em>Super-Charged Condition</em></li>\n<li>4 <strong>Hit Point Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"kaio-ken-x20","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":2,"family":"Non-Race Specific","resource":"other","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"4 Hit Point","activation":"action","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4641,"endLine":4648},"formFamily":"Non-Race Specific"}}}
{"_id":"d90b598731a39a03","name":"Kaio-Ken x50!","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 25 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain the <em>Super-Charged Condition</em></li>\n<li>5 <strong>Hit Point Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"kaio-ken-x50","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":3,"family":"Non-Race Specific","resource":"other","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"5 Hit Point","activation":"action","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4650,"endLine":4655},"formFamily":"Non-Race Specific"}}}
{"_id":"2451ee27ba885223","name":"Kaio-Ken x100!","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d8 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain the <em>Super-Charged Condition</em></li>\n<li>6 <strong>Hit Point Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"kaio-ken-x100","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":3,"family":"Non-Race Specific","resource":"other","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"6 Hit Point","activation":"action","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4656,"endLine":4663},"formFamily":"Non-Race Specific"}}}
{"_id":"0caaf191c60eeb65","name":"Kaio-Ken x200!","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li>+4 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d8 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 35 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain the <em>Super-Charged Condition</em></li>\n<li>7 <strong>Hit Point Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"kaio-ken-x200","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":4,"family":"Non-Race Specific","resource":"other","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"7 Hit Point","activation":"action","powerBonus":4,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4665,"endLine":4670},"formFamily":"Non-Race Specific"}}}
{"_id":"81a3c3bb64a11640","name":"Kaio-Ken x1000!","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li>+5 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d10 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 40 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain the <em>Super-Charged Condition</em></li>\n<li>10 <strong>Hit Point Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"kaio-ken-x1000","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":4,"family":"Non-Race Specific","resource":"other","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"10 Hit Point","activation":"action","powerBonus":5,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4671,"endLine":4685},"formFamily":"Non-Race Specific"}}}
{"_id":"283357f62dd274da","name":"Full Power","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>This Transformation can be learned by anyone as a <strong>Rank 3 Technique.</strong> You buff your body through energy manipulation and fight disregarding the energy drain.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You gain +1 to your <strong>AC.</strong></li>\n<li>+1 <em>Rank of Bulk</em></li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"full-power","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":3,"family":"Full Strength","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Full Strength"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4688,"endLine":4697},"formFamily":"Full Strength"}}}
{"_id":"4fe3ef2ea1a38527","name":"Super Full Power","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Transformation</em></p>\n<p>This Transformation can be learned by anyone as a <strong>Rank 4 Technique</strong> if you have “Full Power”.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You gain +2 to your <strong>AC.</strong></li>\n<li>+2 <em>Ranks of Bulk</em></li>\n<li>4 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"super-full-power","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":4,"family":"Full Strength","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"4 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Full Strength"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4698,"endLine":4707},"formFamily":"Full Strength"}}}
{"_id":"0915fbb3d248a967","name":"Four Witches Technique","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>This Transformation can be learned by anyone as a <strong>Rank 2 Technique.</strong> You grow an additional set of arms out of your back, granting you benefits in combat.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>All <strong>Techniques</strong> that you cast begin as if they were cast for 1 round, if possible.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>You attack with an additional <em>Combo Attack Roll</em> as part of a <strong>Technique</strong> that does multiple <em>Combo Attack Rolls.</em></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>You may make an additional attack as part of the <em>Attack Action</em> or <em>Ki Blast Action</em></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>You may hold a <em>Light Weapon</em> in each additional hand, allowing you to use them as an alternative <em>Off-Hand Weapon.</em> Your <em>Dexterity Modifier</em> is halved with these <em>Weapons.</em></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"four-witches-technique","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":2,"family":"Four Witches","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":0,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Four Witches"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4709,"endLine":4723},"formFamily":"Four Witches"}}}
{"_id":"3100f200b50de1d0","name":"Tier 1","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li>+1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 10 ft.</li>\n<li>1 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"tier-1","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Potential Unlock","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"1 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":1,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Potential Unlock"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4729,"endLine":4734},"formFamily":"Potential Unlock"}}}
{"_id":"12bd34416a7cda94","name":"Tier 2","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li>2 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 20 ft.</li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"tier-2","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Potential Unlock","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":2,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Potential Unlock"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4735,"endLine":4740},"formFamily":"Potential Unlock"}}}
{"_id":"19f7592ecf1f7568","name":"Tier 3 (Ultimate Form)","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<ul>\n<li><p>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 20 ft.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Increase all <em>Damage Die</em> step by 1</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1d4&gt;1d6&gt;1d8&gt;1d10&gt;1d12&gt;2d6&gt;etc</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"tier-3-ultimate-form","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Potential Unlock","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Potential Unlock"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4741,"endLine":4749},"formFamily":"Potential Unlock"}}}
{"_id":"bfe8de43bae47d3f","name":"Tier 4 (Bestial Potential)","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Transformation</em>\nYou have begun to pull out the full potential of the god ki inside you. The user’s hair or defining feature becomes white and your eyes turn white.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+5 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 45 ft.</li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Damage Die</em> by 2 steps<ul>\n<li>1d4&gt;1d6&gt;1d8&gt;1d10&gt;1d12&gt;2d6&gt;etc</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>5 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong>\n<strong>You obtain Tier 4 when you have Tier 3 and aquire God Ki.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"tier-4-bestial-potential","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Potential Unlock","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"5 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":5,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Potential Unlock"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4750,"endLine":4763},"formFamily":"Potential Unlock"}}}
{"_id":"63715cbfcf3303e1","name":"Majin Mark","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Power-Up</em></p>\n<p>A power-up fueled by dark magic and mind control.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 10 ft.</li>\n<li>At the start of your turn, you gain 2 <strong>Stamina</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>This Power-Up is considered active until dispelled.</strong></p>\n<p>The giver of this mark may attempt to control the afflicted a number of times per day equal to their <strong>Wisdom Modifier</strong>. While under control the giver can decide how much control to leave to the afflicted even to the point of fully controlling them until the afflicted can pass the wisdom save. The afflicted make the save once every number of rounds equal to the giver’s <strong>Wisdom Modifier</strong></p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"majin-mark","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Majin Mark","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":1,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Majin Mark"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4766,"endLine":4778},"formFamily":"Majin Mark"}}}
{"_id":"f2c5760e28850cbf","name":"No-Ego","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Power-Up</strong>\nYou master a state of control within your ki that while it may not enhance your strength, refines all control of your capabilities:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You reduce the ki spent on <em>Techniques</em> equal to your Ki-Rank</li>\n<li>You cannot gain the <strong>Berserk</strong> Conditions</li>\n<li>When you would cast a Technique with the name Charge, you increase the amount of ki gained equal to your <strong>Wisdom Modifier</strong></li>\n<li>2 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"no-ego","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"No-Ego","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"2 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":0,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; No-Ego"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4798,"endLine":4806},"formFamily":"No-Ego"}}}
{"_id":"1fae1411231973b8","name":"Pure Progress","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Power-Up</strong>\nYour power grows to adapts to the enemy to the best of your ability:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 <strong>Power Bonus</strong> at the start of your turn, to a maximum to half your <em>Proficiency Bonus</em>, rounded down</li>\n<li>Your <em>Unarmed Damage Die</em> becomes equal to the highest <em>Unarmed Strike or Weapon Damage Die</em> from a hostile creature that targets you, reverting back at the end of this <strong>Form</strong></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 5 ft. per every <strong>Power</strong> you have from this <strong>Form</strong></li>\n<li>Your <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong> equal your <strong>Ki Rank</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"pure-progress","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Pure Progress","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":1,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Pure Progress"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4808,"endLine":4817},"formFamily":"Pure Progress"}}}
{"_id":"f7d8a988db7dc5cd","name":"Dark Energy","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Prerequisite: Ancient Saiyan or Ate the Fruit of the Tree of Might at level 10 or beyond.</strong>\n<strong>Power-Up</strong>\nYou must be of the <strong>Evil Alignment</strong> to gain this form. If you are of the <strong>Good</strong> or <strong>Neutral Alignment</strong> and gain this form, you must make a <em>Wisdom Saving Throw</em> against <strong>DC 25</strong>, on a failure, you gain the <em>Berserk Condition</em>. You lose access to the <em>Super Saiyan God</em> <strong>Power-Up</strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+3 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +1d8 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5>Dark Energy Techniques</h5>\n<h6>Dark Weapons</h6>\n<p><em>Rank 3 Ki Technique</em></p>\n<p><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>   20 Ki\n<strong>Prerequisites:</strong>   <em>Dark Energy</em>\n<strong>Casting Time:</strong>   1 Bonus Action\n<strong>Range:</strong>          Self\n<strong>Type:</strong>     Omni\n<strong>Duration:</strong>       Upkeep (5 Ki)</p>\n<p>You begin to form hands from your dark aura, allowing you to attack from a distance even while restrained or bound. All melee attacks that you make gain a reach of 20. Additionally if you would get disadvantage on an attack that is not from the <em>Blinded</em> or <em>Invisible Conditions</em>, you may ignore it if you attack a creature further than 5 feet from you.</p>\n<p>Each time you <em>Master</em> this <strong>Technique</strong>, you increase the reach by 10</p>\n<h6>Dark Corruption</h6>\n<p><em>Rank 4 Ki Technique</em></p>\n<p><strong>Ki Cost:</strong>   50 Ki\n<strong>Prerequisites:</strong>   <em>Dark Energy</em>\n<strong>Casting Time:</strong>   1 Action\n<strong>Range:</strong>          Self (5 foot radius)\n<strong>Type:</strong>     Omni\n<strong>Duration:</strong>       1 Minute</p>\n<p>The Evil Aura engulfs any creature within it, forcing them to go on an evil Berserker Rage against anyone except you. All targets in range must make a <em>Wisdom Saving Throw</em>, on a failure they gain the <em>Dark Energy</em> <strong>Power-Up</strong>. Targets of <em>Good/Neutral Alignment</em> immedietly fail <em>Dark Energy's</em> <em>Wisdom Saving Throw.</em></p>\n<p>Saiyans with <em>Super Saiyan God</em> can be effected by this <strong>Technique</strong> without losing <em>Super Saiyan God</em>. Targets under the effect of this <strong>Technique</strong> can not target you with <em>Attack Rolls</em>, <strong>Techniques, Spells,</strong> or <strong>Features</strong>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"dark-energy","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"powerUp","rank":null,"family":"Non-Race Specific","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"bonus","powerBonus":3,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":false,"requirements":"Prerequisite: Ancient Saiyan or Ate the Fruit of the Tree of Might at level 10 or beyond.; Prerequisites:**   *Dark Energy","tags":"Non-Race Specific"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4818,"endLine":4868},"formFamily":"Non-Race Specific"}}}
{"_id":"c63725e8d45b7741","name":"Ultra Instinct Omen","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The ultimate defensive ability, though incomplete. The user’s body will react to protect itself without the consent or thought of the user. This ability was once thought impossible to mortals.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+4 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +2d4 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 30 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain +3 to your <strong>AC.</strong></li>\n<li>You gain an additional Reaction that can only be used for <strong>Maneuvers</strong></li>\n<li>While in this form you may not use <strong>Techniques</strong> unless they have at least <strong>1 Mastery Rank.</strong></li>\n<li>4 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Your first 3 times entering this form happen when you would hit zero <strong>Hit Points</strong> you instead awaken in this form regaining 50% of your <strong>HP</strong> and <strong>Ki</strong>. This form then lasts until your <strong>HP</strong>, <strong>Ki</strong>, or <strong>Stamina</strong> reaches 0.</p>\n<p>On your 4th activation, you instead enter <em>Completed Ultra Instinct</em> and can then unlock the ability to enter this form at will.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ultra-instinct-omen","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Ultra Instinct","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"4 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":4,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Ultra Instinct"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4872,"endLine":4888},"formFamily":"Ultra Instinct"}}}
{"_id":"20fbe6e085be1b02","name":"Complete Ultra Instinct","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The ultimate defensive ability, finally complete, the user’s body will react to protect itself without the consent or thought of the user. This ability was once thought impossible even by the gods.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+4 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +2d8 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 60 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain +4 to your <strong>AC.</strong></li>\n<li>You gain an additional Reaction that can be used for <strong>Maneuvers</strong> or <strong>Techniques</strong> that has a casting time of a Reaction</li>\n<li>6 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Your second and third time entering this form happen when you would hit 3 death saving throws you instead awaken in this form regaining 25% of your Hp, Ki, and stamina. This form then lasts until your HP, KI, or Stamina reaches 0. After your third transformation, you may undergo a dedicated training arc with an angel to access this <em>Ultra Instinct Omen</em> at will.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"complete-ultra-instinct","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Ultra Instinct","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"6 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":4,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Ultra Instinct"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4889,"endLine":4904},"formFamily":"Ultra Instinct"}}}
{"_id":"35581e108eee5160","name":"True Ultra Instinct","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Transformation</em></p>\n<p>You have taken Ultra Instinct to its natural conclusion using not only your combat knowledge and training but who you are as a person, a fighter, and a soul culminating into a form with full mind and emotion.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+5 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +2d10 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 90 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain +4 to your <strong>AC.</strong></li>\n<li>You gain 2 additional Reactions that can be used for <strong>Maneuvers</strong> or <strong>Techniques</strong> that has a casting time of a Reaction</li>\n<li>6 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>{{note</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"true-ultra-instinct","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Ultra Instinct","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"6 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":5,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Ultra Instinct"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4905,"endLine":4917},"formFamily":"Ultra Instinct"}}}
{"_id":"a976f313918dc1c7","name":"Ultra Ego Omen","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The ultimate destruction ability, though incomplete, the user begins its first stages in the mindset of the God of Destruction with one single goal, to destroy.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+4 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +2d4 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase your <em>Movement Speed</em> by 20 ft.</li>\n<li>4 <strong>Stamina Activation</strong>, 3 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n<li>While in this form you have a rising pool of <em>Destruction Energy</em>. At the end of each of your turns while this is active you gain 1d8 added to this pool of <em>Destruction Energy</em>. You may do the following features with these <em>Destruction Energy Dice</em>:</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em><strong>Destroy.</strong></em> Your fuel your ki attacks with the power of destruction.</p>\n<p>When you land an <em>Attack Roll</em> or <strong>Technique</strong> you may spend any number of dice from your <em>Destruction Energy Dice</em> and add that much <em>Destruction Damage</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ultra-ego-omen","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Ultra Ego","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"3 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":4,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Ultra Ego"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4934,"endLine":4957},"formFamily":"Ultra Ego"}}}
{"_id":"035cd2b3c1bf6fe4","name":"Ultra Ego","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Transformation</em></p>\n<p>The ultimate destructive ability, finally complete, the user's ki attacks and punches will make the complete erasure of a creature, erasing not only their bodies, but their soul, never ending up in another world.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+4 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +2d6 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 40 ft.</li>\n<li>5 <strong>Stamina Activation</strong>, 4 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n<li>While in this form you have a rising pool of <em>Destruction Energy</em>. At the end of each of your turns while this is active you gain 2d4 added to this pool of <em>Destruction Energy</em>. You may do the following features with these <em>Destruction Energy Dice</em>:</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em><strong>Fighting Spirit.</strong></em> Your form relies on your fighting spirit and you can burn your destruction energy to help restart your destructive blaze.</p>\n<p>As an Action, you may roll any number of dice from your <em>Destruction Pool</em> and gain that amount of <strong>Temporary HP</strong> or <strong>Temporary Ki</strong> equal to the total rolled. You may not use this <strong>Feature</strong> again until all previous <strong>Temporary HP</strong> or <strong>Temporary Ki</strong> gained through this feature are depleted.\n<em><strong>Destroy.</strong></em> Your fuel your ki attacks with the power of destruction.</p>\n<p>When you land an <em>Attack Roll</em> or <strong>Technique</strong> you may spend any number of dice from your <em>Destruction Energy Dice</em> and add that much <em>Destruction Damage</em>.</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"ultra-ego","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Ultra Ego","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"4 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":4,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Ultra Ego"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4958,"endLine":4979},"formFamily":"Ultra Ego"}}}
{"_id":"d200b985dcc7d3ce","name":"Burning Ultra Ego","type":"form","img":"systems/dragons-and-ballz/icons/svg/items/feature.svg","system":{"description":{"value":"<p><em>Godly Transformation</em></p>\n<p>When your body and mind are in sync with only 1 objective ahead “Destroy”. You may enter a transformation of Destruction called Ultra Ego, ultimately characterized by its ability to grow in power as your fighting spirit grows.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>+5 <strong>Power Bonus</strong></li>\n<li>You deal +2d8 to all <em>Damage Rolls</em></li>\n<li>Increase all <em>Movement Speed</em> by 60 ft.</li>\n<li>You gain +4 to your <strong>AC.</strong></li>\n<li>6 <strong>Stamina Activation</strong>, 5 <strong>Stamina Upkeep</strong></li>\n<li>While in this form you have a rising pool of <em>Destruction Energy</em>. At the end of each of your turns while this is active you gain 2d6 added to this pool of <em>Destruction Energy</em>.  You may do the following features with these <em>Destruction Energy Dice</em>:</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em><strong>Fighting Spirit.</strong></em> Your form relies on your fighting spirit and you can burn your destruction energy to help restart your destructive blaze.</p>\n<p>As an Action, you may roll any number of dice from your <em>Destruction Energy Dice</em> and gain that amount of <strong>Temporary HP</strong> or <strong>Temporary Ki</strong> equal to the total rolled. You may not use this <strong>Feature</strong> again until all previous <strong>Temporary HP</strong> or <strong>Temporary Ki</strong> gained through this feature are depleted.\n<em><strong>Destroy.</strong></em> Your fuel your ki attacks with the power of destruction.</p>\n<p>When you land an <em>Attack Roll</em> or <strong>Technique</strong> you may spend any number of dice from your <em>Destruction Energy Dice</em> and add that much <em>Destruction Damage</em>.\n<em><strong>Neverending Destruction</strong></em> You burn the energy of destruction like a star to keep it alight.</p>\n<p>As an Action, you may spend any number of <em>Destruction Energy Dice</em> and gain 1 <strong>Temporary Stamina</strong> for each die spent. You may not use this <strong>Feature</strong> again until all previous <strong>Temporary Stamina</strong> gained through this <strong>Feature</strong> are depleted.</p>\n<p>{{note</p>\n","chat":""},"identifier":"burning-ultra-ego","source":{"custom":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook"},"category":"transformation","rank":null,"family":"Ultra Ego","resource":"stamina","activationCost":"","upkeepCost":"5 Stamina","activation":"action","powerBonus":5,"berserker":false,"berserkDC":null,"godly":true,"requirements":"","tags":"Non-Race Specific; Ultra Ego"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"flags":{"dragons-and-ballz":{"handbook":{"chapter":"Dragons and BallZ Handbook","startLine":4980,"endLine":5007},"formFamily":"Ultra Ego"}}}
